[38;5;252m[1m## Scope[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The project is a single translation unit ([38;5;10mdriver.c[0m, 58 lines). [38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m declares [1mno [38;5;10m[features][0m[22m and [38;5;10mCMakeLists.txt[0m declares no build options, so there is exactly [1mone[22m valid configuration — not a matrix. [38;5;10mverify.sh[0m still enumerates the feature powerset programmatically (and would fan out automatically if features were added); I substituted the debug/release profile axis as the second dimension, since that turned out to matter.[0m[0m
